sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>(llm-d inference gateway)
    participant API as API Server<br/>Port 8000 (TLS opt-in)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Store as S3/Filesystem<br/>File Store
    participant Queue as Redis/Valkey<br/>Work Exchange
    participant Proc as Processor
    participant LLMd as llm-d Inference<br/>Gateway
    participant GC as Garbage Collector
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Batch Submission Flow

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/batches<br/>Authorization: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>API: Forward request<br/>X-MaaS-Username header
    API->>API: Validate request<br/>Extract tenant from X-MaaS-Username
    API->>PG: INSERT batch metadata
    PG-->>API: batch_id
    API->>Store: Upload input file (.jsonl)
    Store-->>API: file_id
    API->>Queue: LPUSH batch_id to pending queue
    Queue-->>API: OK
    API-->>Gateway: 200 OK {batch_id, status: pending}
    Gateway-->>Client: Batch created

    Note over Client,OTel: Batch Processing Flow

    loop Poll for pending batches
        Proc->>Queue: BRPOP pending queue
        Queue-->>Proc: batch_id
    end

    Proc->>PG: SELECT batch details
    PG-->>Proc: batch metadata
    Proc->>Store: Download input file
    Store-->>Proc: input records (.jsonl)

    loop Fan-out inference requests
        Proc->>LLMd: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization passthrough
        LLMd-->>Proc: Inference result
    end

    Proc->>Store: Upload output file (.jsonl)
    Proc->>PG: UPDATE batch status = completed

    Note over Client,OTel: Result Retrieval Flow

    Client->>Gateway: GET /v1/batches/{batch_id}
    Gateway->>API: Forward
    API->>PG: SELECT batch status
    PG-->>API: status: completed, output_file_id
    API-->>Gateway: {status: completed, output_file_id}
    Gateway-->>Client: Batch status

    Client->>Gateway: GET /v1/files/{file_id}/content
    Gateway->>API: Forward
    API->>Store: Get output file
    Store-->>API: output content
    API-->>Gateway: File content
    Gateway-->>Client: Results (.jsonl)

    Note over Client,OTel: Garbage Collection Flow

    loop Configurable schedule
        GC->>PG: SELECT expired batches/files (TTL check)
        PG-->>GC: expired records
        GC->>Store: DELETE expired files
        Store-->>GC: OK
        GC->>PG: DELETE expired metadata
        PG-->>GC: OK
    end

    Note over Client,OTel: Observability (all workloads)

    API-->>OTel: Traces (OTLP/gRPC)
    Proc-->>OTel: Traces (OTLP/gRPC)
    GC-->>OTel: Traces (OTLP/gRPC)
